Timing jitter, \sigma_t 2.5
Sled release variability, \sigma_{\text{rel}} 3.0
Track flatness, \sigma_{\text{flat}} 1.5
Lunar libration, \sigma_{\text{lib}} 2.0
Correlation \rho(t,\text{lib}) 0.3

The covariance matrix is

\boldsymbol{\Sigma} =
\begin{pmatrix}
